Value Required ADDRESS (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value MAC (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value TYPE (\S+)
Value HOSTNAME (\S+)

#? (192.0.2.35) at 00:00:5e:00:53:35 [ether] on bond1.100
#? (192.0.2.177) at <incomplete> on bond1.200
#host01.example.com (198.51.100.63) at 00:00:5e:00:53:63 [ether] on bond1.300

Start
  ^${HOSTNAME}\s+\(${ADDRESS}\)\s+at\s+${MAC}\s+\[${TYPE}\]\s+on\s+${INTERFACE}$$ -> Record
  ^.*$$
  ^. -> Error
